## Critical Rules
- ALWAYS use TypeScript interfaces for props
- USE PascalCase for component names
- USE kebab-case for file and directory names
- ALWAYS extract reusable logic into custom hooks
- NEVER use default exports for components
- ALWAYS add 'use client' directive when using client-side React features
- PLACE context providers in src/context directory
- DEFINE all types in src/types directory
- USE named exports for all components and hooks